{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f419a924-51b9-4876-a36e-7657f918647d",
    "name": "Smart Stop Display API",
    "description": "API collection for the FHNW Smart Stop Display project. This collection contains endpoints for the Swiss Public Transport API (transport.opendata.ch) used to fetch public transport data for display on ESP32-based LCD screens.\n\n**Base URL:** `http://transport.opendata.ch/v1/`\n\n**Rate Limiting:** Requests are constrained by the rate limit of timetable.search.ch.\n\n**Use Cases:**\n\n- Search for stations and locations\n    \n- Get connections between two stations\n    \n- Display departure/arrival boards for specific stations",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
